WEBVTT

00:01.150 --> 00:03.230
The cultural festival's 
coming up soon, isn't it?

00:03.670 --> 00:06.880
Why don't you get your ears pierced 
or something for the occasion?

00:06.880 --> 00:07.660
Why, though?

00:07.660 --> 00:11.400
Because it's your big day!

00:11.400 --> 00:13.710
I'm not doing anything, though.

00:14.230 --> 00:16.160
Plus, I said it doesn't suit me.

00:16.810 --> 00:21.050
You told me to dye my hair, so 
I did, and it doesn't look good.

00:21.050 --> 00:22.910
Sure it does.

00:22.910 --> 00:24.790
Why are you so negative?

00:24.790 --> 00:27.130
Have more confidence in yourself.

00:27.450 --> 00:28.790
I'm not getting piercings.

00:32.720 --> 00:36.050
<i>That kind of fanciness only looks 
good on certain kinds of people.</i>

00:36.400 --> 00:39.060
<i>Outgoing people like Someya-san.</i>

00:39.060 --> 00:41.760
<i>Or good looking guys like Azuma-kun.</i>

00:41.760 --> 00:43.180
<i>Me, get my ears pierced?</i>

00:43.180 --> 00:45.290
<i>I'm not that full of myself.</i>

00:45.290 --> 00:47.270
<i>I'd have to hide my face forever.</i>

00:51.030 --> 00:55.030
<b>Class 3-B</b>

00:51.590 --> 00:55.030
<i>M-Mie-san, please, don't hide your face!</i>

01:02.800 --> 01:03.880
The Girl I Like 
her Glasses

01:03.880 --> 01:06.890
The Girl I Like 
Forgot her Glasses

02:25.620 --> 02:30.590
Episode 11

02:25.620 --> 02:30.590
On the Day of the Cultural Festival, 
The Girl I Like and I...

02:26.150 --> 02:28.370
Morning, Komura-kun.

02:28.610 --> 02:30.420
Wh-Wh-What's wrong?

02:30.420 --> 02:31.890
What happened to you?

02:31.890 --> 02:33.630
I dropped something.

02:34.800 --> 02:37.510
I can't find it. It's really small.

02:37.510 --> 02:39.180
I-I see.

02:40.310 --> 02:41.630
What did you drop?

02:42.290 --> 02:43.730
Well...

02:43.730 --> 02:45.810
Oh, found it.

02:46.300 --> 02:48.590
That's good to hear.

02:51.860 --> 02:53.100
<i>A piercing?!</i>

02:53.680 --> 02:55.980
Sorry about the fuss.

02:55.980 --> 02:56.820
Nah.

02:57.440 --> 02:58.490
<i>No...</i>

02:58.490 --> 03:00.500
<i>That wasn't what I thought it was, was it?</i>

03:00.500 --> 03:04.080
<i>I've never seen Mie-san with a piercing.</i>

03:04.080 --> 03:06.870
<i>Wait, does she have her ears pierced?</i>

03:07.270 --> 03:09.850
<i>No, no way...</i>

03:09.850 --> 03:12.880
<i>It's not that it wouldn't look 
good on her, but, like...</i>

03:13.130 --> 03:15.130
All right, everyone, take your seats.

03:16.240 --> 03:18.530
W-Wanna share textbooks?

03:18.950 --> 03:19.650
Yeah.

03:19.650 --> 03:20.590
Thanks.

03:20.880 --> 03:23.050
<i>Mie-san with piercings...</i>

03:26.210 --> 03:27.220
<i>Why...</i>

03:28.120 --> 03:30.060
<i>Why does that seem so naughty?</i>

03:33.820 --> 03:35.980
All right, let's get started.

03:37.010 --> 03:40.050
We'll start by going over 
what we learned last time.

03:38.900 --> 03:41.350
<i>It doesn't look like she has piercings...</i>

03:41.350 --> 03:43.490
<i>It must have been a misunderstanding, right?</i>

03:44.000 --> 03:47.330
<i>Or is it not something you can 
tell just by looking at it?</i>

03:48.340 --> 03:49.870
Hey, about this part...

03:51.190 --> 03:53.490
Oh, you can't see the textbook.

03:53.490 --> 03:54.550
Sorry.

03:54.550 --> 03:57.240
No, I'm sorry.

03:57.240 --> 03:58.090
Really.

03:58.090 --> 04:02.590
<b>Textiles</b>

03:58.640 --> 03:59.760
<i>Yeah...</i>

03:59.760 --> 04:02.590
<i>I just have my own prejudices.</i>

04:02.590 --> 04:07.150
<i>There's nothing to be shocked 
about even if she's got piercings.</i>

04:08.810 --> 04:12.160
<i>I feel like this is the only 
thing I've thought about all day.</i>

04:12.160 --> 04:13.700
<i>Get a grip already, me!</i>

04:13.700 --> 04:14.630
Komura-kun.

04:14.630 --> 04:15.840
Look, look.

04:17.520 --> 04:18.510
A piercing.

04:22.850 --> 04:24.060
It's just a bead.

04:26.860 --> 04:29.160
I don't have piercings.

04:30.300 --> 04:32.330
Is that what you lost this morning, too?

04:33.990 --> 04:36.970
What are you using beads for?

04:36.970 --> 04:37.770
Eyes.

04:37.770 --> 04:39.210
Oh, eyes.

04:39.570 --> 04:40.280
Eyes?

04:42.330 --> 04:43.060
For these.

04:43.500 --> 04:45.840
I'm presenting it at the cultural festival.

04:46.530 --> 04:47.720
<i>A flapjack octopus?</i>

04:47.720 --> 04:53.860
It's already cute, but I thought 
it might be even cuter with eyes.

04:55.190 --> 04:57.180
<i>She likes so many things.</i>

04:57.180 --> 04:59.450
<i>She thinks about all kinds of things.</i>

04:59.450 --> 05:02.330
<i>Maybe that's why Mie-san 
seems so special to me.</i>

05:02.790 --> 05:07.680
<i>Meanwhile, I was told to make whatever 
I want using felt and cotton,</i>

05:07.410 --> 05:12.370
3-B Komura Pincushion

05:07.410 --> 05:12.370
Expected completed
product

05:07.680 --> 05:09.920
<i>and I'm just making a ball.</i>

05:09.920 --> 05:16.200
<i>Empty, boring people like me don't look good 
with dyed hair and piercings and stuff.</i>

05:18.360 --> 05:21.960
I wonder if they use 
needles to make piercings.

05:23.260 --> 05:25.700
P-Please don't put that 
too close to your face.

05:25.700 --> 05:27.900
It's not a piercing gun.

05:27.900 --> 05:29.140
I see.

05:29.520 --> 05:33.890
I think piercings are cute, 
but they're kinda scary to do.

05:34.150 --> 05:36.030
Y-Yeah.

05:36.030 --> 05:39.650
My family tells me to do 
it, too, but it scares me.

05:40.590 --> 05:44.100
I mean, I know it wouldn't 
look good on me, but...

05:45.960 --> 05:46.740
What...

05:46.740 --> 05:47.490
Eh?

05:53.720 --> 05:55.450
You might look cool.

06:00.350 --> 06:05.120
Oh, I can't see properly right 
now though, so I can't be sure.

06:05.120 --> 06:06.760
Oh, right.

06:14.580 --> 06:15.520
<i>Relax!</i>

06:16.000 --> 06:17.170
<i>Relax!</i>

06:17.640 --> 06:19.260
<i>It wouldn't suit me! It wouldn't suit me!</i>

06:17.640 --> 06:20.520
<b>First-time Piercing
 Instant Piercings</b>

06:19.840 --> 06:22.240
<i>I wouldn't look cool!</i>

06:22.240 --> 06:23.490
<i>Damn it!</i>

06:23.490 --> 06:28.910
<i>One word from Mie-san can empower me to do 
anything and can compel me to do anything.</i>

06:31.510 --> 06:36.730
<i>With the cultural festival almost here, 
we're finalizing our preparations.</i>

06:36.730 --> 06:38.850
It's almost six.

06:40.270 --> 06:43.530
I want to get it done today, if I can, but...

06:43.530 --> 06:46.360
My curfew's at six.

06:46.360 --> 06:47.510
I know.

06:47.510 --> 06:49.430
You should try breaking your curfew.

06:49.950 --> 06:51.840
No way. That's scary.

06:51.840 --> 06:55.260
<i>Mie-san's parents are probably pretty 
strict about that kind of thing.</i>

06:55.260 --> 06:57.070
Do you get punished or something?

06:57.070 --> 07:00.270
Well, first of all, I'll get scolded.

07:00.970 --> 07:05.150
Worst of all, I don't get 
cocoa the next morning.

07:05.150 --> 07:07.070
<i>That's terrible!</i>

07:11.530 --> 07:14.070
Hey, since it doesn't look 
like we'll be done in time...

07:14.470 --> 07:17.760
Raise your hand if you can 
stay until around seven.

07:19.580 --> 07:21.780
<i>I do live relatively close.</i>

07:21.780 --> 07:22.740
Thanks!

07:22.740 --> 07:25.460
Let's get it done as fast as we can.

07:26.220 --> 07:27.550
Hey, Komura...

07:28.580 --> 07:30.720
Have you and Mie-san kissed already?

07:30.720 --> 07:33.090
<i>Are we </i>still<i> talking about this?</i>

07:33.540 --> 07:34.460
Um...

07:34.460 --> 07:36.280
Tell me if something happens, okay?

07:36.280 --> 07:38.390
I won't tell anyone, I swear.

07:41.850 --> 07:43.170
What's up, Mie-san?

07:43.170 --> 07:46.910
<i>Sh-She didn't hear anything about 
kissing or anything, did she?</i>

07:46.910 --> 07:48.600
M-Me, too.

07:49.710 --> 07:52.940
I can stay until seven.

07:52.940 --> 07:55.570
We have to prepare for the 
cultural festival, after all.

07:55.570 --> 07:56.730
Yay!

07:56.730 --> 07:59.370
For real? Mercy buckets!

08:00.500 --> 08:02.950
<i>She's acting a bit weird.</i>

08:02.950 --> 08:05.170
<i>Is she really going to be okay?</i>

08:05.170 --> 08:09.100
<i>Is there any reason she'd lie 
just to stay behind, though?</i>

08:11.120 --> 08:12.880
<i>Because she wants to walk home with me?</i>

08:15.890 --> 08:17.870
What's wrong with you, Komura?

08:17.870 --> 08:19.770
Oh, nothing.

08:20.300 --> 08:22.030
Just trying to wake myself up.

08:22.030 --> 08:23.000
Are you sleepy?

08:23.440 --> 08:25.460
<i>Why would I think she'd want to</i>

08:25.460 --> 08:29.780
<i>get yelled at by her parents and be deprived 
of her morning cocoa just to hang out with me?</i>

08:30.400 --> 08:33.210
<i>I need to bring it down a notch.</i>

08:33.210 --> 08:36.880
Okay, you two can deal with this thing.

08:41.530 --> 08:44.940
Let's put out these name tags and art pieces.

08:45.350 --> 08:46.120
Okay.

08:53.050 --> 08:54.650
What time is it?

08:54.650 --> 08:56.910
Almost six.

08:57.890 --> 09:00.210
M-Mie-san, are you all right?

09:00.210 --> 09:01.890
Y-Yeah.

09:01.890 --> 09:07.400
I've never been at school this late 
before, so I'm feeling a bit anxious.

09:07.400 --> 09:10.960
<i>Is that really it?</i>

09:10.960 --> 09:12.650
Let's try to get it done quick.

09:18.750 --> 09:23.480
<i>Mie-san spent half an hour and 
finally got the third exhibit done.</i>

09:24.780 --> 09:28.510
<i>Sh-Should I tell her she should go home?</i>

09:29.080 --> 09:31.520
<i>She said she's fine, though.</i>

09:31.520 --> 09:33.090
<i>I don't want to be too persistent.</i>

09:35.440 --> 09:36.350
Huh?

09:36.350 --> 09:38.690
<i>Isn't that Mie-san's phone?</i>

09:39.740 --> 09:41.050
<i>It's on the ground.</i>

09:43.430 --> 09:45.930
Mom

09:43.430 --> 09:45.930
3 missed calls

09:43.430 --> 09:45.930
Mom

09:43.430 --> 09:45.930
What are you doing?

09:43.430 --> 09:45.930
Mom

09:43.430 --> 09:45.930
Ai?

09:51.410 --> 09:53.330
Hey, where's Komura-kun?

09:55.080 --> 09:57.270
Huh? Where is he?

09:57.270 --> 09:58.350
Did he leave?

10:18.220 --> 10:20.600
Asuka-chan, sorry, I'm going home.

10:20.600 --> 10:21.890
Sure.

10:21.890 --> 10:22.960
Bye.

10:22.960 --> 10:24.120
Be safe.

10:32.250 --> 10:34.990
Hey, where do these go?

10:35.440 --> 10:36.490
Oh...

10:39.680 --> 10:41.870
<i>Why am I going after her?</i>

10:41.870 --> 10:44.570
<i>It's not like there's anything I can do now.</i>

10:47.370 --> 10:50.370
<i>She can't find her shoe cubby!</i>

10:50.790 --> 10:53.230
<i>She must have opened that one first!</i>

10:53.230 --> 10:55.380
<i>That was her cubby in second year!</i>

10:55.380 --> 10:58.760
<i>And now she's completely confused.</i>

10:58.760 --> 11:00.380
<i>Relax, please!</i>

11:01.760 --> 11:03.640
<i>Did she just give up and 
put on her gym shoes?</i>

11:07.390 --> 11:09.420
<i>I need to give her her shoes.</i>

11:10.820 --> 11:13.200
<i>Mie-san and I had the same shoes.</i>

11:13.200 --> 11:16.230
<i>She got mine confused 
with hers and wore mine.</i>

11:17.010 --> 11:18.890
<i>I remember that.</i>

11:19.440 --> 11:22.340
<i>She's still using the same shoes, I guess.</i>

11:23.780 --> 11:26.740
<i>Wait, I don't think I could hand her these.</i>

11:26.740 --> 11:28.910
<i>She'd wonder why I'm following her.</i>

11:29.480 --> 11:35.250
<i>I-I guess I could just pass it off as a 
coincidence if I told her I was just on my way home, too.</i>

12:09.990 --> 12:11.560
<i>I'll give them to her tomorrow.</i>

12:13.180 --> 12:18.400
<i>Tomorrow, she'll have been scolded by 
her mom and missed her morning cocoa.</i>

12:18.970 --> 12:22.880
<i>Mie-san's going to be a bit down tomorrow.</i>

12:26.670 --> 12:29.000
Why were you out so late?

12:29.000 --> 12:30.180
You never even contacted me.

12:30.860 --> 12:32.230
I'm sorry.

12:32.230 --> 12:33.920
Just eat your dinner.

12:39.180 --> 12:40.350
I'll get it.

12:40.350 --> 12:41.380
Go inside.

12:43.810 --> 12:45.070
U-Um...

12:46.970 --> 12:51.160
Sorry, I'm M-Mie-san's classmate.

12:52.670 --> 12:54.070
A friend?

12:54.070 --> 12:55.900
K-Komura-kun.

12:55.900 --> 12:56.790
Ah.

12:56.790 --> 13:00.110
Uh, these are Mie-san's shoes.

13:00.620 --> 13:03.300
I wore them home by accident.

13:03.610 --> 13:06.530
They're the same shoes, so...

13:06.530 --> 13:08.640
S-Sorry, Mie-san.

13:08.980 --> 13:12.500
You didn't end up getting home 
late because of it, did you?

13:12.500 --> 13:13.770
Because you didn't have your shoes.

13:16.610 --> 13:20.310
N-Not really.

13:21.380 --> 13:23.410
O-Okay.

13:24.300 --> 13:26.350
W-Well, see you.

13:26.350 --> 13:27.480
See you tomorrow.

13:29.100 --> 13:30.340
Pardon me.

13:32.700 --> 13:35.430
So that's why you came 
home in your gym shoes?

13:36.410 --> 13:37.660
Well, whatever.

13:37.660 --> 13:38.970
Go eat dinner.

13:46.160 --> 13:49.380
<i>I might have been imposing, 
visiting her home.</i>

13:49.380 --> 13:51.330
<i>And I was totally acting weird.</i>

13:52.240 --> 13:54.430
<i>Her mom was pretty.</i>

13:56.120 --> 14:01.540
<i>Sorry, Mie-san, I just want 
to see you happy tomorrow.</i>

14:03.620 --> 14:04.740
<i>I'm so selfish.</i>

14:06.370 --> 14:08.270
<i>I'm beyond hope.</i>

14:15.950 --> 14:16.860
Komura-kun.

14:16.860 --> 14:17.960
Morning.

14:20.460 --> 14:22.120
M-Morning.

14:23.400 --> 14:24.810
G-Glasses.

14:25.680 --> 14:26.130
Yeah.

14:26.340 --> 14:28.790
I forgot them once, though.

14:28.790 --> 14:31.390
When I took them off because my 
cocoa was making them cloudy.

14:34.880 --> 14:36.160
Y-Yeah?

14:43.560 --> 14:45.400
<i>Thank goodness she seems okay.</i>

14:45.870 --> 14:48.150
<i>Thank goodness I didn't cause trouble.</i>

14:48.580 --> 14:51.950
<i>Thank God I wasn't suspected 
of being a stalker!</i>

14:52.860 --> 14:55.370
<i>Things that happened recently.</i>

14:55.370 --> 14:59.870
<i>Number one: There was a clione mascot 
in the crane catcher at the bath house.</i>

15:00.160 --> 15:05.630
<i>I like both things, so I got really into 
it, and used up all my allowance money.</i>

15:05.630 --> 15:11.040
<i>I shouldn't get so focused on things 
that I lose sight of everything else.</i>

15:11.630 --> 15:13.390
<i>She's just slightly off the mark.</i>

15:14.160 --> 15:15.700
What are you staring at?

15:16.170 --> 15:17.520
Oh, nothing.

15:17.920 --> 15:20.810
That Mie-san's a weird one.

15:18.060 --> 15:23.060
<b>Cultural
Festival
Day</b>

15:21.420 --> 15:23.060
Yeah... I guess.

15:24.180 --> 15:28.360
I could never write anything this amusing.

15:28.630 --> 15:30.840
Things that happened recently.

15:30.840 --> 15:37.110
Number two: I wanted yellow thread, but 
since it was night, I asked my dad to come with me.

15:37.110 --> 15:39.690
<i>She's really close to her dad.</i>

15:39.690 --> 15:43.120
Number three: I broke my curfew.

15:44.000 --> 15:51.170
And my mom said I couldn't have my 
morning cocoa, but my dad allowed it.

15:46.300 --> 15:47.150
Nope.

15:46.460 --> 15:48.590
<b>Mom</b>

15:48.720 --> 15:50.850
<b>Dad</b>

15:48.740 --> 15:49.710
All right.

15:53.770 --> 15:55.900
<i>Thank you, Dad!</i>

15:57.180 --> 15:59.430
3-B Mie Ai
 Flapjack Octopus

15:58.160 --> 15:59.430
<i>It's cute.</i>

16:00.000 --> 16:02.390
<i>It's cute like Mie-san!</i>

16:02.820 --> 16:04.540
<i>Oh, I see.</i>

16:04.540 --> 16:05.650
<i>Yellow thread.</i>

16:06.160 --> 16:10.330
<i>Whether it's choosing yellow for the 
thread or the beads for the eyes...</i>

16:10.330 --> 16:12.860
<i>She must be enjoying every idea.</i>

16:13.620 --> 16:16.780
<i>Was the cultural festival ever this fun?</i>

16:17.280 --> 16:18.670
Asuka-chan.

16:18.670 --> 16:19.950
What's up? Mie-chan.

16:20.700 --> 16:22.340
I'm getting a bit tired.

16:22.340 --> 16:24.190
I'm going to take a break here.

16:24.190 --> 16:25.290
Here?

16:25.680 --> 16:27.960
<i>N-No one was watching me, were they?</i>

16:28.400 --> 16:31.700
<i>Nah, I mean, I was just 
looking at the exhibits.</i>

16:35.200 --> 16:38.510
<i>Sh-She's looking at my exhibit!</i>

16:36.220 --> 16:38.510
<b>Komura
Kaede</b>

16:36.220 --> 16:38.510
<b>Pincushion</b>

16:39.280 --> 16:40.270
<i>Please don't look!</i>

16:40.270 --> 16:43.280
<i>It's just a plain old circle!</i>

16:43.280 --> 16:45.770
<i>She's going to find out 
how disappointing I am!</i>

16:45.770 --> 16:47.860
<i>Sh-She's still looking?</i>

16:47.860 --> 16:49.980
<i>What is there even to look at?</i>

16:51.520 --> 16:53.580
<i>Sh-She's wearing her glasses, isn't she?</i>

16:53.990 --> 16:59.540
<i>Oh yeah, knowing her, maybe she's having 
fun counting the stitches or something.</i>

17:03.950 --> 17:07.050
<i>It's really not even worth 
looking at so carefully.</i>

17:08.130 --> 17:12.010
We will now present each club's works.

17:16.290 --> 17:17.590
<i>Is she going to the bathroom?</i>

17:18.240 --> 17:19.500
<i>I'll go, too.</i>

17:22.670 --> 17:24.040
Komura-kun.

17:25.190 --> 17:26.300
What's up?

17:28.120 --> 17:30.470
Wh-What about you, Mie-san?

17:30.470 --> 17:32.360
J-Just felt like it.

17:32.360 --> 17:33.690
J-Just felt like it?

17:35.580 --> 17:37.560
It's weird, isn't it?

17:37.560 --> 17:39.730
It's midday, and no one's here.

17:39.730 --> 17:42.580
<i>How is my life so awesome right now?</i>

17:43.080 --> 17:45.290
I read your diary, Komura-kun.

17:46.220 --> 17:49.000
Oh, about the things that happened recently.

17:49.370 --> 17:52.910
Like, you choose your words so carefully.

17:52.910 --> 17:53.760
I like it.

17:56.160 --> 17:58.680
I-I read yours, too.

17:58.680 --> 17:59.670
Really?

18:00.870 --> 18:02.800
I-It's amusing.

18:02.800 --> 18:03.890
I liked it.

18:04.220 --> 18:05.640
Are you making fun of me?

18:05.640 --> 18:07.190
Of course not!

18:14.820 --> 18:16.320
Wait, wait, wait!

18:17.820 --> 18:19.830
A-Are you going to look at my face?

18:20.320 --> 18:21.060
Yes.

18:21.470 --> 18:22.200
No?

18:22.450 --> 18:25.000
Wh-What if someone sees us?

18:25.000 --> 18:26.660
Everyone's in the gym.

18:26.950 --> 18:30.080
B-Besides, you're wearing your glasses today.

18:30.080 --> 18:32.040
You don't need to look at my face like that.

18:34.180 --> 18:37.710
Am I being too demanding these days?

18:39.090 --> 18:42.510
I've been having too much fun lately.

18:42.830 --> 18:45.520
I think I've been acting spoiled.

18:45.830 --> 18:49.020
I-I don't think so.

18:54.380 --> 18:59.030
Wh-Why do you want to see my face so often?

18:59.280 --> 19:03.150
<i>It's really not even worth 
looking at so carefully.</i>

19:03.150 --> 19:04.730
It's calming.

19:06.580 --> 19:08.600
O-Okay.

19:09.750 --> 19:10.410
Yeah.

19:11.260 --> 19:12.520
<i>What?</i>

19:12.520 --> 19:15.020
<i>What was I expecting?</i>

19:15.900 --> 19:16.840
But...

19:19.170 --> 19:22.550
I still think I've been 
getting carried away, though.

19:23.400 --> 19:27.310
So I'll hold back from looking 
at your face all the time.

19:29.600 --> 19:31.220
I-It's fine.

19:32.190 --> 19:34.250
You don't need to hold back.

19:34.250 --> 19:36.640
I don't mind at all.

19:36.640 --> 19:38.440
If you want to look.

19:38.440 --> 19:39.710
<i>I mean...</i>

19:39.710 --> 19:41.200
<i>That's not right!</i>

19:41.200 --> 19:44.250
<i>That's such a cowardly thing to say!</i>

19:44.250 --> 19:45.950
I mean...

19:47.950 --> 19:50.310
<i>It's not for her!</i>

19:50.310 --> 19:51.010
I...

19:51.010 --> 19:51.960
Me, too.

19:52.300 --> 19:53.960
You, too?

19:55.460 --> 19:56.620
Komura-kun.

19:58.380 --> 19:59.260
Sure.

20:03.730 --> 20:04.630
Sure.

20:07.340 --> 20:08.360
<i>I...</i>

20:11.490 --> 20:13.340
<i>I'm a dull person.</i>

20:13.770 --> 20:17.980
<i>Selfish, and probably a bit creepy.</i>

20:18.790 --> 20:27.120
<i>But I still want to keep looking at Mie-san.</i>

20:35.450 --> 20:36.640
What's wrong?

20:37.700 --> 20:39.630
I-I don't know.

20:39.630 --> 20:41.030
Are you okay?

20:41.030 --> 20:42.260
Y-Yeah.

20:43.240 --> 20:48.010
Though, I'll try to control 
myself just a little better.

20:48.430 --> 20:49.040
Okay.

20:49.780 --> 20:50.590
Yeah.

20:50.590 --> 20:54.020
Hey, I've been thinking...

20:54.020 --> 20:57.190
You're kind of like a dad.

20:58.490 --> 20:59.560
A dad?

21:00.450 --> 21:00.960
Yeah.

21:00.960 --> 21:03.110
How you're really nice and stuff.

21:04.040 --> 21:06.570
Is that why I always act so spoiled?

21:07.210 --> 21:08.280
<i>Dad?</i>

21:08.760 --> 21:09.760
<i>I see.</i>

21:09.760 --> 21:12.080
<i>So that's why she thinks I'm calming.</i>

21:12.080 --> 21:14.800
Do you think we should get back now?

21:14.800 --> 21:15.670
Wanna go back?

21:15.670 --> 21:18.480
<i>Is that the only way she sees me?</i>

21:18.480 --> 21:19.740
Komura-kun?

21:20.840 --> 21:21.990
Oh, right.

21:21.990 --> 21:24.340
Come to think of it, I wonder...

21:25.090 --> 21:27.160
Are we going to get in trouble for this?

21:27.160 --> 21:29.010
<i></i>Now<i> she's worried.</i>

21:31.230 --> 21:32.520
Oh, well.

21:32.740 --> 21:34.700
As long as you're with me.

21:35.900 --> 21:37.700
<i>A dad, huh?</i>

23:10.540 --> 23:12.120
Komura Kaede here.

23:12.120 --> 23:13.520
I'm going to do the next episode preview.

23:14.030 --> 23:15.620
"It's cooking practice day."

23:15.620 --> 23:16.950
Cooking practice?

23:16.950 --> 23:21.080
I hope I get to try something Mie-san makes.

23:21.780 --> 23:22.880
No, no.

23:22.880 --> 23:24.460
I have to focus on the preview.

23:25.840 --> 23:27.440
"It's cooking practice day."

23:27.440 --> 23:31.470
"Komura-kun doesn't get 
to be in Mie-san's group."

23:31.470 --> 23:33.220
I don't?!

23:33.600 --> 23:35.050
That's the end of the preview?!

23:35.050 --> 23:35.910
Next episode:

23:35.060 --> 23:39.980
Episode 12

23:35.060 --> 23:39.980
I Wanted To Practice Cooking
With the Girl I Like

23:35.910 --> 23:38.640
"I Wanted To Practice Cooking 
With the Girl I Like."

23:38.640 --> 23:39.810
"<i>Wanted</i> to"?!
